    "reviews": "\u201c\u201cA game so bizarre and incredibly unique that it gives us anxiety to even talk about it.\u201d\u201d<br>StonedGamer<br><br>\u201c\u201cViktor is a beautifully hand drawn point and click steampunk adventure, full of colorful characters, inventive puzzles and wonderfully irreverent humor.\u201d\u201d<br>AlphaBetaGamer<br><br>\u201c&quot;In the end though, it was not the gameplay that won me over, but the humor.&quot;\u201d<br>RINCON<br>",
